OL,3,ATrial over alleged murders of
OL,4,AAustralian surfer brothers starts in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FProsecutors are seeking jail sentences
OL,8,Fof more than 200 years for the
OL,9,Fdefendants, who also face charges of
OL,10,Fviolent robbery and auto theft.
OL,12,FThe parents of the brothers were in
OL,13,Fcourt on Tuesday in the coastal town of
OL,14,FEnsenada, telling the media that it was
OL,15,F"incredibly important and
OL,16,Foverwhelmingly difficult".
